{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 21, :comments ["<b>And if you say in your heart.</b> You are destined to say this when Hananiah son of Azzur comes and prophesies: ״הִנֵּה כְלֵי בֵית ה' מוּשָׁבִים מִבָּבֶלָה עַתָּה מְהֵרָה״ (Jeremiah 27), while Jeremiah stands and cries out: regarding ״אֶל הָעַמֻּדִים וְעַל הַיָּם וְעַל יֶתֶר הַכֵּלִים״ that were not exiled with Jechoniah — ״בָּבֶלָה יוּבָאוּ״ with the exile of Zedekiah (there)."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 18, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:47:38.936585965Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}